        "messageBody": "…e per node (ADR-0021)\n\nThe Blocked guard added to _require_awaiting_acceptance_review in 61eb17c walked\neverything above the node outside a read scope, so every upstream node reloaded\nits reviews: one decision cost O(n^2), building an Accepted chain O(n^3). The\n200-node chain fixture in test_performance.py took 244 s to set up on macOS and\npushed the Windows CI jobs past their 45-minute limit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
